This product includes the built-in agent definitions under agents/, whose
security condition sets were derived from Prowler
(https://github.com/prowler-cloud/prowler), Copyright the Prowler authors,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. A copy of that license is at
http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0.

What was derived and what was not:

  - The set of conditions each agent looks for was derived from the critical
    and high severity checks in Prowler's catalogue.

  - No Prowler source code is included.

  - No Prowler prose is included. Prowler's check titles, descriptions, risk
    and remediation text are not reproduced, quoted or paraphrased. Every line
    of every agent prompt was written for this repository.

  - Some Prowler checks carry tags referencing external benchmarks such as CIS.
    No benchmark text is included and none was consulted.
